# Shadcn UI Components Rule

- Use shadcn UI for all user interface components in this project.
- Do not build custom base UI primitives if a shadcn component exists.
- If a required shadcn component is missing, install it with:

```bash
npx shadcn@latest add <component-name>
```

Example:

```bash
npx shadcn@latest add accordion
```
